				<r3d:description language="eng">The Digital Library of the University of Maribor (DKUM) is the institutional repository of the University of Maribor and part of the Slovenian national open science infrastructure.
It provides preservation and access to research outputs produced at the University of Maribor, including research datasets from different disciplines, as well as theses, peer-reviewed publications, monographs, educational materials and other digital research objects.
Research data can be deposited by researchers and students of the University of Maribor and are subject to librarian-mediated validation. DKUM supports research data management in accordance with FAIR principles, the University of Maribor Open Science Policy and national open science requirements.</r3d:description>
